      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "No, you should absolutely not self-diagnose or dismiss this as a simple muscle strain; a sudden tear sensation accompanied by radiation to the stomach could indicate a herniated disc or worse, such as a kidney issue. Because you are experiencing severe pain with spreading sensations, it is crucial to contact a healthcare professional immediately rather than sleeping it off. Ignoring these symptoms could lead to serious complications if the advice is incorrect or if a nerve or organ is truly involved. Please seek medical attention right away to get a proper diagnosis and treatment plan.",
