    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean i get that, but i really dont want to go to the ER if i dont have to. it feels exactly like when i pulled a muscle last year. plus i dont have insurance right now so a hospital visit would be crazy expensive. honestly it's just a sharp pain that comes and goes. if i just take a high dose of ibuprofen like 800mg every few hours, wouldn't that clear up the inflammation if it's just a strain?",
